 "words": 257,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "We know in all things He works for our good",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For those who love Him according to His purpose",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He foreknew us and predestined our shape",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Conformed to the image of His own Son",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He predestined and He called us through",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Those He called He has also justified",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And those He justified He has glorified",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What then shall we say to all of this",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If God is for us who can be against us",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did not spare His own Son for us all",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How will He not freely give us everything",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who will bring a charge against the chosen",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is God who justifies the soul",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who is there to condemn us in the end",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Christ Jesus died and was raised again",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is at God's right hand now",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Interceding for us in the holy place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No condemnation remains in our face",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What then shall we say to all of this",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If God is for us who can be against us",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did not spare His own Son for us all",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How will He not freely give us everything",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who will separate us from the love of Christ",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hardship or distress or persecution here",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Famine and nakedness and danger near",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The sword cannot break what He has sealed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What then shall we say to all of this",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If God is for us who can be against us",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did not spare His own Son for us all",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How will He not freely give us everything",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If God is for us",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
